Third-party material:

- open_fly/brain.py reproduces the neuron and synapse equations and
  constants of model.py from philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model,
  Copyright (c) 2023 Philip Shiu and Nico Spiller, licensed under the MIT License.
- open_fly/sensory_ids.json lists FlyWire neuron ids taken from the
  notebooks of the same repository (MIT).
- The FlyWire connectome and annotations are not included; they are downloaded
  at run time. Cite the FlyWire papers listed in README.md when using results.
- The website build derives web/data/connectome.bin and web/data/brain.json from
  the FlyWire v783 connectome and annotations and from the model repository's
  files (tools/export_web_brain.py), and serves them. They are built in CI and
  never committed; the attribution they require is shown on the page.
- patches/opendoctrines-agent-door.patch modifies Open Doctrines
  (github.com/Pr1nted/Open-Doctrines) under that project's own licence.
